:: University_Gate
    <img class='scene' src='img/locations/university_gate.jpg'>
    <<Updates>>
    <<speech 'plr'>>Now that is a gate! Sadly, it looks very much locked. And the air seems to shimmer along the outer wall. An illusion? Maybe a shield? Not sure yet.<</speech>>
